# PLOP — photos → editable 3D digital twins

Monorepo layout:
- `apps/web` — Vite + React + TypeScript + react-three-fiber front end (port 5174)
- `services/api` — FastAPI reconstruction/agent service (port 8100, venv at `.venv`)
- `vendor/hive` — vendored Hive swarm (MIT); keep its UI untouched
- `scripts/dev.sh` — runs all four services

Conventions:
- Real-world units everywhere: meters in scene docs, cm in UI copy.
- Deterministic geometry/constraint logic lives in `services/api/app/constraints.py` —
  never let an LLM invent numbers the constraint engine can compute.
- LLM access only through `services/api/providers` (Grok primary, Anthropic fallback).
- New 3D objects go in `apps/web/src/lib/objectLibrary.ts` as procedural builders
  scaled to real dimensions.
- Run `npx tsc -b` in `apps/web` and `pytest` in `services/api` before committing.
